      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the Shiba Inu dog as the speaker of the text",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the Shiba Inu dog, which is visually mapped as the speaker of the text 'I'm not transphobic i just don't like 'em'. The dog's smug expression serves as a visual proxy for the user's implied attitude, creating an identification where the user sees themselves as the entity making this dismissive statement. This projection is implicit, relying on the meme format's convention of using the dog to represent the speaker, without explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
